  "description": "The Adobe predefined CMaps (the 59 of ISO 32000-2 Table 116 besides Identity-H/V) and the CID-to-Unicode tables of the Adobe CJK character collections for Broadside, used to map character codes to CIDs and Unicode for composite fonts that name a predefined CMap instead of embedding one. Wire it in with options.UsePredefinedCMaps(). The data is Adobe's cmap-resources and mapping-resources-pdf (BSD-3-Clause), unmodified. No native dependencies.",
